The data files are unchanged. <category> is each of: simple_python, simple_java,
simple_javascript, multiple, parallel, parallel_multiple, irrelevance,
live_simple, live_multiple, live_parallel, live_parallel_multiple,
live_irrelevance, live_relevance.

Not copied from BFCL: vendor/bfcl_eval/constants/model_config.py is a small
stand-in written for this repository (see the docstring in that file).

